    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-Ith1">
        <head xml:id="gom-Ith1-Hd1e98">Caput 1</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ith1-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ith1-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith1-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith1-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith1_1@3-5">Silvanus et Timotheus.</quote>
            Nominibus illorum praescribitur salutatio, sed sensus et verba hujus epistolae solius apostoli sunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith1-d1e110">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith1-Qd1e112" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith1_1@15-18">Gratia vobis et pax.</quote>
            De more suo salutationem praemittit, qua praemissa de bonis eorum gratias agit, commemorans non solum fidem et opera, sed etiam conversionis modum et malorum sustinentiam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ith1-Dd1e117">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ith1-Hd1e119">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith1-d1e121">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0615D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith1-Qd1e125" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith1_3@16-17">Ante Deum.</quote>
            Inde ita certi ac si jam videatis, et ita eos animat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-Ith1-Dd1e130">
          <head xml:id="gom-Ith1-Hd1e132">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith1-d1e134">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith1-Qd1e136" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith1_5@16-18">In Spiritu sancto.</quote>
            Quia per me recepistis dona Spiritus, non parce, sed in plenitudine.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-Ith1-d1e140">
            <quote xml:id="gom-Ith1-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/Ith1_5@25-26">Quales fuerimus,</quote>
            etc. Per hoc etiam quod nos passi sumus in exemplum vobis, patet quod Deus vos dilexit et elegit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
